if {BearSpirit.traded_today} != true:
	if {BearSpirit.introduced} != true:
		bear_spirit: Ah... a visitor. It has been some time since footsteps found their way this deep.
		bear_spirit: I was not always still like this. I was a bear once — flesh, fur, hunger, the whole clumsy business of living.
		bear_spirit: Now I am only the shape of one, kept here by whatever this shrine remembers of me.
		bear_spirit: I do not ask for much. An offering, freely given, is worth more than anything taken.
		bear_spirit: Leave what you can spare, and I will see that you leave with something worth the trade — an old habit of mine, from when debts still meant something out there in the light.
		bear_spirit: Sit with me a while if you like. I don't move much these days, but I'm told I make good company. Better than the dark, at least.
		bear_spirit: Now then — what have you brought me?
		- Give Fish
			if {BearSpirit.player_has_fish} == true:
				[signal arg="give_fish"]
				if {BearSpirit.reward_item} != "":
					bear_spirit: A fine offering. Here — take this.
					bear_spirit: You received {BearSpirit.reward_item}.
					[end_timeline]
				else:
					bear_spirit: I've already accepted your gift for today. Come back tomorrow.
					[end_timeline]
			else:
				bear_spirit: You don't seem to be carrying any fish.
				[end_timeline]
		- Give Honey
			if {BearSpirit.player_has_honey} == true:
				[signal arg="give_honey"]
				if {BearSpirit.reward_item} != "":
					bear_spirit: Honey... a rare gift indeed. Take this in return.
					bear_spirit: You received {BearSpirit.reward_item}.
					[end_timeline]
				else:
					bear_spirit: I've already accepted your gift for today. Come back tomorrow.
					[end_timeline]
			else:
				bear_spirit: You don't seem to be carrying any honey.
				[end_timeline]
	else:
		bear_spirit: Ah... It's you again,
		bear_spirit: What have you brought for me this time?
	- Give Fish
		if {BearSpirit.player_has_fish} == true:
			[signal arg="give_fish"]
			if {BearSpirit.reward_item} != "":
				bear_spirit: A fine offering. Here — take this.
				bear_spirit: You received {BearSpirit.reward_item}.
				[end_timeline]
			else:
				bear_spirit: I've already accepted your gift for today. Come back tomorrow.
				[end_timeline]
		else:
			bear_spirit: You don't seem to be carrying any fish.
			[end_timeline]
	- Give Honey
		if {BearSpirit.player_has_honey} == true:
			[signal arg="give_honey"]
			if {BearSpirit.reward_item} != "":
				bear_spirit: Honey... a rare gift indeed. Take this in return.
				bear_spirit: You received {BearSpirit.reward_item}.
				[end_timeline]
			else:
				bear_spirit: I've already accepted your gift for today. Come back tomorrow.
				[end_timeline]
		else:
			bear_spirit: You don't seem to be carrying any honey.
			[end_timeline]
else:
	bear_spirit: I'm already satisfied with your gift today. Come back again tomorrow.
	[end_timeline]